{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function createObjectStore(\n   db,\n   storeName,\n   options?): IDBObjectStore;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: packages/db/src/indexed-db-wrapper.ts:179"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Creates an object store during a database upgrade."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This function must be called within an onupgradeneeded callback\n(i.e., within a versionchange transaction). Calling it outside of\nan upgrade context will throw an error."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"db","children":[{"type":"text","value":"db"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"IDBDatabase"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The IDBDatabase instance"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"storename","children":[{"type":"text","value":"storeName"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The name of the object store to create"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"IDBObjectStoreParameters"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional configuration for the object store (keyPath, autoIncrement)"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"IDBObjectStore"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The created IDBObjectStore"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"throws","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Throws"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Error if not called during a version change transaction"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const db = await openDatabase('myApp', 1, (db) => {\n  createObjectStore(db, 'todos', { keyPath: 'id' })\n  createObjectStore(db, 'users', { keyPath: 'id', autoIncrement: true })\n})","lang":"typescript"}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"db","text":"db","level":3},{"id":"storename","text":"storeName","level":3},{"id":"options","text":"options?","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"throws","text":"Throws","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction createObjectStore(\n   db,\n   storeName,\n   options?): IDBObjectStore;\n```\n\nDefined in: packages/db/src/indexed-db-wrapper.ts:179\n\nCreates an object store during a database upgrade.\n\nThis function must be called within an onupgradeneeded callback\n(i.e., within a versionchange transaction). Calling it outside of\nan upgrade context will throw an error.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### db\n\n`IDBDatabase`\n\nThe IDBDatabase instance\n\n### storeName\n\n`string`\n\nThe name of the object store to create\n\n### options?\n\n`IDBObjectStoreParameters`\n\nOptional configuration for the object store (keyPath, autoIncrement)\n\n## Returns\n\n`IDBObjectStore`\n\nThe created IDBObjectStore\n\n## Throws\n\nError if not called during a version change transaction\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\nconst db = await openDatabase('myApp', 1, (db) => {\n  createObjectStore(db, 'todos', { keyPath: 'id' })\n  createObjectStore(db, 'users', { keyPath: 'id', autoIncrement: true })\n})\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: createObjectStore\ntitle: createObjectStore\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction createObjectStore(\n   db,\n   storeName,\n   options?): IDBObjectStore;\n```\n\nDefined in: packages/db/src/indexed-db-wrapper.ts:179\n\nCreates an object store during a database upgrade.\n\nThis function must be called within an onupgradeneeded callback\n(i.e., within a versionchange transaction). Calling it outside of\nan upgrade context will throw an error.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### db\n\n`IDBDatabase`\n\nThe IDBDatabase instance\n\n### storeName\n\n`string`\n\nThe name of the object store to create\n\n### options?\n\n`IDBObjectStoreParameters`\n\nOptional configuration for the object store (keyPath, autoIncrement)\n\n## Returns\n\n`IDBObjectStore`\n\nThe created IDBObjectStore\n\n## Throws\n\nError if not called during a version change transaction\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\nconst db = await openDatabase('myApp', 1, (db) => {\n  createObjectStore(db, 'todos', { keyPath: 'id' })\n  createObjectStore(db, 'users', { keyPath: 'id', autoIncrement: true })\n})\n```\n"}
